{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06691","headline":"田家即事 · 储光羲","name":"田家即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑柘悠悠水蘸堤，晚风晴景不妨犂。\n高机犹织卧蚕子，下坂饥逢饷饁妻。\n杏色满林羊酪熟，麦凉浮壠雉媒低。\n生时乐死皆由命，事在皇天志不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「田家即事」条，撰者方　牧、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"方 牧"}